[JAWA-2684] RCA corrective actions: unique constraint, rate limit, race condition fix, dedupe audit

## Changes

### 1. DB unique constraint (critical)
- Added `ciaa_case_number` CharField (unique, nullable) to Case model
- Auto-populated from special:* ref in court_cases on save
- Migration: 0036_add_ciaa_case_number_unique_constraint

### 2. Race condition fix (discover_and_draft_cases.py)
- Switched dedup from title__icontains to ciaa_case_number lookup
- Switched get_or_create from (title, case_type) to (ciaa_case_number,)
- DB unique constraint now guarantees idempotency under concurrent invocations

### 3. Cross-pipeline dedup unification (ciaa_draft_case_service.py)
- check_case_exists now uses ciaa_case_number instead of JSONB containment
- map_json_to_case extracts ciaa_case_number from court_cases
- Case.objects.create call now passes ciaa_case_number

### 4. Rate limiting on POST /api/cases/ (throttles.py + api_views.py)
- Added CaseCreateRateThrottle with tiered limits:
  - Admin/Moderator: 100/hour
  - Contributor: 50/hour
  - Default: 10/hour
- Wired via get_throttles() on CaseViewSet for create action only

### 5. Dedupe audit script (scripts/dedupe_ciaa_cases.sql)
- SQL queries to find duplicate DRAFT corruption cases
- Summary stats and null-ciaa_case_number backfill candidates
- Resolution strategy documented in script

### 6. PR #202 verification
- PR #202 (Audit all API mutations) merged at commit 23c5bf5, June 13
- 7 models now audited; audit actor gap fixed; bulk .update() bypass closed

